# A hopper's removeItem/setItem do NOT call setChanged (HopperBlockEntity overrides them): ejecting its only item and sucking a new one leaves no transient empty reading, so the compare-mode comparator reading it schedules no tick and never updates its front (the QC dropper there stays untriggered). Dropper removeItem/setItem do notify.
